@startuml

title ComponentHub - View and Reuse a Component

actor User
participant "Component page\n(app.js)" as UI
participant "Catalogue client\n(catalogue.js)" as Client
participant "Express API" as API
database "SQLite" as DB

User -> UI: Open component details
UI -> Client: getComponent(componentId)
Client -> API: GET /api/components/{id}\nAuthorization: JWT
API -> DB: Fetch and hydrate component
DB --> API: Component record
API --> Client: Component details
Client -> Client: Merge component into cache
Client --> UI: Normalized component
UI -> User: Display metadata and reuse action

User -> UI: Click Use / Open resource
UI -> Client: markUsed(componentId)
Client -> API: POST /api/components/{id}/use
API -> DB: Increment used_count\nDecrement queried_not_used_count
DB --> API: Updated component
API --> Client: Updated component
Client -> Client: Merge updated component
Client --> UI: Usage recorded
UI -> User: Open resource URL and refresh details

alt Component not found or request unauthorized
  API --> Client: 404/401 error
  Client --> UI: Throw error or redirect
  UI --> User: Show error
end
@enduml
